<!-- The Tuppu mark (T-216): a clay tablet with three rows of cuneiform wedges, the list pressed
     into it, in the app's violet-to-blue gradient. The web favicon draws the same two paths, so
     both clients show the identical picture. Used on the login screen and the Overview corner;
     the launcher foreground (ic_launcher_foreground.xml) and the notification icon
     (ic_notification.xml) carry copies of the paths, since a drawable cannot include another. -->
